#. i18n: file: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui:208
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, kcfg_startWithGdb)
#: rc.cpp:180 languages/cpp/debugger/gdboutputwidget.cpp:63
